<title>UK: Aluminium output unchanged in June - IPAI.</title>
<headline>Aluminium output unchanged in June - IPAI.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daily average primary aluminium output was unchanged in June at 52,900 tonnes compared with the previous month and 50,800 in June 1996, provisional figures from the International Primary Aluminium Institute (IPAI) show.</p>
<p>Total production in June 1997 (30 days) was 1.587 million tonnes, compared with 1.640 million in May (31 days) and 1.523 million in June 1996.</p>
<p>The regional breakdown of primary aluminium production was as follows (in thousands of tonnes) the IPAI said.</p>
<p>			 Jun 97   May 97    Jun 96</p>
<p>Africa		    90     93	  87</p>
<p>N.America		487    502	 480</p>
<p>S.America		175    180	 172</p>
<p>East/South Asia	155    162	 130</p>
<p>Europe West	    269    277	 261</p>
<p>Europe East/Central  271    282	 259</p>
<p>Ocenaia		  140    144	 134</p>
<p>London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7771</p>
